# eng_text = `Then we used carry a cone as a carry Bag to put the stuff. At that time there are only two markets in a week (for Jowai) i.e. Khyllaw and yaw Musiang; Khyllaw market is a small market, in Jaintia yaw Musiang is the biggest market..'  
