# eng_text = `Before going to school we just took the school bag from somewhere and then go. We never study like the kids nowadays do, we study only during exam that too just for some time, even then when the results came out sometimes we passed sometimes we failed since we don�t even utilize the sources just like the present kids. Even to our children also we could see the difference between our time and theirs..'  
