# eng_text = `where is your cemetery? They said they don�t have one. So I said, do you hear that father daloi? No burial and no cremation place. Yes they have stayed here, they stayed in our territory(raid raliang),so I announce now, that from today on that you should understand, I speak with heavy words to all your members,like the way that raliang people eat here, it should be the raliang people who should look over for you.'  
