# eng_text = `so at the time,the whole village was in conflict, the resident questioned us, how can we be constructing a field in a land that belongs to mr karbar? We arranged for a meeting and made them understand, 3-4 times we had to call for a public meeting. he (mr karbar) tried to find ways to conflict the village and the villagers, he tried to break my position as the headman, he broke every rules that was laid down by the village, the village was free of liquor and this guy would bribe people by buying liquor for people.'  
# pbv_text = hei-tæ i-por, por khat ki i kattæ baroh ka-chnong ka-por ka-chnong ka-por ka ya peit ya phra wathooh, han pa ya kam luti ya-yah paidbah phi ha wa yeithaw dei ong karbar i-ong paidbah, heiti pyrsñiawthooh pyllun dorbar, le soo sein ynnu karbar, ong da thooh lad u kamnu pynsih i ka-chnong ka-por, toh oo lad u-tyngkheiñ hadooh ya nga ka u-rongbah chnong, tyngkheiñ ya kitæ ki-aiñ chnong kattæ wi mut ki-chnong ki-thaw o, khangkiet lut, toh u-ni toh dei theid u-wi ki-bru pynbih pynba man oo tæ man.
