# eng_text = `because in olden times if a mother gave birth on the market day known as 'mulong', the child was named as 'long', on the market day 'musiang the child was named as 'musiang', if on 'muchai the child was named as 'chai', if on 'pyngkat the child was named as 'kat', if on 'thymbleN the child was named 'leN', if on 'hat the child was named as 'hat', if on 'khyllaw the child was named as 'law', if on 'pynsiñ the child was named as 'siñ', the children was named after the market days they were born on, but most of the children in modern days were named in English mostly".'  
